  "body": "Direct-PR: hand-applied `ledger-note` of #984 by the docs steward (AGENTS §8)\nClaim: cloud/orch\nAuthor model: Opus 5.5 (cloud/orch)\nReviewer model: Fable 5.2 (cloud/orch ledger-notes reviewer; r1 REQUEST CHANGES on b610ff04, r2 APPROVE on 35be4c18)\n\nThe `ledger-note` of #984 (#902):\n\n> GAP-230 (« not gated by \"Images externes\" ») and UX decision 7 (« Image policy C … replace \"always load\" »): after #902 there is no « Images externes » setting and images always load; policy C's Wi-Fi/tap modes exist only behind Réglages › Expérimental › « Chargement des images ». Reword both by hand.\n\nChanges in `docs/migration/GAP-LEGACY-VS-SWIFT.md`:\n- **GAP-230**: « not gated by any image setting (there is no « Images externes » setting since #902, and the experimental « Chargement des images » choice does not apply to avatars) ».\n- **UX decision 7**: « Images always load by default, as in legacy (#902, operator 2026-11-16); image policy C (Wi-Fi auto, cellular on tap) is an option behind Réglages › Expérimental › « Chargement des images ». Tap-to-play videos replace \"always load\" ».\n\n`tooling/docs/fold.py --check`: ok.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_014QH2CGTbJ8LjeZ6VYEWrtJ)_",
