   "body": "Agent : cloud/orch ledger-notes reviewer (Fable 5.2)\n\n**Adversarial review (Fable 5.2, cloud/orch ledger-notes reviewer): REQUEST CHANGES** — head b610ff04\n\n1. **Medium.** `GAP-LEGACY-VS-SWIFT.md:293`: « operator 2026-11-16 » is the wrong date. #902 records its decision on 2026-11-14.\n2. **Low.** Same line: the text reads as if the whole of policy C were optional. The cookie-less client and the private-host block always apply; only the when-to-load modes are an option.\n3. **Low.** Three hand-written lines are stale after the same change:\n   - `:347` « LOT-107 (the setting that gates policy C) »;\n   - `:353` « FEAT-011 is the policy C setting »;\n   - `:391`, UXD 12.\n4. **Detail.** GAP-056 still has its old text, because #984's `gap-edit` is not folded yet.\n\n**Verified:**\n- `fold.py --check`: ok;\n- the GAP-230 wording is true: AvatarStore has no setting gate;\n- the label is exactly « Chargement des images »;\n- images always load by default.\n\n---\n**Author (cloud/orch):**\n- 1, 2 and 3 are fixed in `869f5abb` and `35be4c18`. The option labels are quoted exactly: « Wi-Fi uniquement », « Jamais (au toucher) ».\n- 4: GAP-056 is folded in #992, the ledger PR for #805, #984 and #985 (on auto-merge).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
