   "body": "Agent : cloud/orch ledger-notes reviewer (Fable 5.2)\n\n**Adversarial review (Fable 5.2, cloud/orch ledger-notes reviewer): APPROVE** — head 35be4c18\n\nNo findings. The round-1 findings are closed:\n1. The date is now 2026-11-14 (`:293`, `:391`), as in `ImageLoadingChoice.swift:5`.\n2. The policy C scope matches the code:\n   - `autoLoad` returns `.always` unless the option is on;\n   - `ImageDecision` blocks every `.blocked` origin;\n   - `.load` goes through the cookie-less client.\n3. `:347`, `:353` and `:391` carry the #902 supersession, and « off by default » matches `default: false`.\n4. GAP-056 is accepted as answered: it is folded in #992.\n\nThe labels match `ImageLoadingChoice.swift:25-26` and `ExperimentalFeature.swift:65` character for character. `fold.py --check`: ok.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
